phitex-graphite is a port to Rust of graphite2 1.3.15, the Graphite
smart-font rendering engine by SIL International
(https://github.com/silnrsi/graphite, release 1.3.15, the version the
TeX Live 2026 XeTeX this port is checked against runs with).

